<h2 id="h-species-xt-vs-alaskan-xt">Bear Species XT RTH vs Bear Alaskan XT RTH</h2>
<p>The question we hear most often is whether to buy the Species XT or step up to the <?= post_link('bear-archery-alaskan-xt-rth-compound-bow', 'Bear Alaskan XT RTH') ?>. Both are Bear ready-to-hunt packages with 80% let-off and the same two draw weight ranges, but they are built around different priorities.</p>
