    ],
    'Choosing a Species XT draw weight range'
) ?>
<p>Draw length matters even more than draw weight for accuracy. A bow that is too long makes you overextend and slap your forearm; too short and you will crowd the string. Retailers ask you to specify draw length when ordering, and a pro shop can fine-tune it. If you plan to change it yourself later, read our guide on <?= post_link('how-to-adjust-draw-length', 'how to adjust draw length') ?> first, then retune the peep and rest.</p>

