<h2 id="h-care-and-maintenance">Care and Maintenance</h2>
<p>The Species XT is easy to maintain, but a few habits keep it shooting where you aim:</p>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><strong>Wax the string and cables</strong> every few weeks of regular shooting.</li>
  <li><strong>Check accessory screws</strong> on the sight, rest, quiver and stabilizer before every hunt.</li>
  <li><strong>Replace the rest insert</strong> when the bristles loosen and stop holding the arrow firmly.</li>
  <li><strong>Never dry-fire</strong> the bow. Releasing without an arrow can damage the cam, limbs and string.</li>
  <li><strong>Store and transport it in a case</strong>. A padded <?= amz('soft compound bow case', 'soft bow case') ?> protects the sight pins.</li>
</ol>

