<h2 id="h-final-thoughts">Final Thoughts on the Bear Archery Species XT RTH</h2>
<p>The Bear Archery Species XT RTH compound bow package does what most hunters need: it shows up nearly ready, forgives the small mistakes that happen in the stand, and fits a wide range of shooters. It will not win a speed contest, and you should expect to upgrade a piece or two over time. But for a first serious hunting bow, or a dependable whitetail rig, it is one of the easiest bows in Bear&rsquo;s lineup to recommend. Get it tuned, buy good arrows, and put your effort into practice.</p>

